# payload bits in fbin min/max). Compare a Vitreo run with
#   python3 tools/oracle_probe/d3d11_a09a_compare.py a09a_input.bin \
#       tools/oracle_probe/d3d11_a09a_alu_probe.expected vit.txt
#
# Verdicts for Vitreo (build 2026-09-27 23:22), full detail in
# .docs/audits/2026-09-28-d3d11-contract-audit/area-09a-shader-alu.md:
#   WRONG   fself c0/c1/c3/c11, funary c21: eq/ne/ge x,x (isnan) folded under
#           Metal Relaxed math (correct with VITREO_METAL_MATH_MODE=safe)
#   WRONG   funary c18/c28, iunary2 c8: f32tof16 is RNE + overflows to INF;
#           spec 3.2.2 is round-to-zero, clamp to +-65504
#   WRONG   funary c10/c11/c26/c27: sin/cos(NaN, +-INF) = 0, spec NaN
#   WRONG   funary c0/c24: frc(+-INF) = 0 (spec NaN); frc(-tiny) = 1.0
#   WRONG   acc c2, funary c7/c31: sqrt up to 1.5 ULP (spec 1 ULP)
#   WRONG   (minor) denormals not flushed by mov -x, mul x*+-1.0, movc -a/|b|
#   MISSING halfneg, iunary: f32tof16 with -/-|x| source modifier -> E_FAIL
#   MISSING p_uaddc, p_usubb (opcodes 132/133) -> E_FAIL
#   MISSING call (call inside switch), p_callc, p_subretc, p_subifret -> E_FAIL
#   MISSING iface_*, linked_fbin: CreateClassLinkage E_NOTIMPL, fcall untranslated;
#           interface shader + NULL linkage: WARP 0x80070057, Vitreo 0x80004005
#   correct (optional, not advertised) double, double_ext, msad -> creation fails
#   correct everything else: ibin, iunary2 (bit ops), tmpl_*/p_bfe/p_umul/
#           p_imul/p_retc/p_continuec/p_topcall/p_swdef*, cflow, indexable,
#           minprec, add/mul/div/mad/dp/min/max/exp/log/rcp/rsq/round/ftoi/ftou/
#           itof/utof/f16tof32 (within the spec's NaN/denorm/fused latitude)
#
