# patched in for the ineg (d3d11_a09a_build.sh); measured on winoracle with the same
# a09a_alu64.exe: the modifier is a float negate of the converted result.
# 2026-09-28 (doubles pass): double and double_ext now run (DOUBLES /
# ExtendedDoubles TRUE, soft_double.hpp). double: identical; double_ext:
